{"product":{"id":10058309239072,"title":"Terreno T10 Hardpack Gravel Sport","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThe go-to choice for when the pavement ends.\u003c\/strong\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith a T-score of 10, the Terreno T10 (formerly the Terreno Zero) is ideal for riders who spend most of their time on pavement or hardpacked gravel but want a tire that can handle occasional detours with confidence. Optimized for efficiency on firm surfaces, the T10 rolls effortlessly while maintaining essential grip for real-world gravel riding—making it the go-to choice for events with mixed sections or fast endurance rides.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Terreno T10 Hardpack Gravel Sport tire is the road-efficient model in the Vittoria Gravel Sport range, engineered for better performance on compact surfaces. A Corsa-inspired, fast-rolling slick center strip is paired with revolutionary fish scale shoulders, adapted from the Terreno T30, for added cornering grip and better handling on wet or variable terrain.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFrom tarmac to fast-rolling hardpack, the T10 brings road-like efficiency to the gravel world. Built with Sport Formulation and Casing, the T10 Hardpack balances performance and reliability, making it the perfect and convenient companion for recreational riders who want a tire that’s dependable and ready for whatever gravel roads throw at them.\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Vittoria","product_type":"Gravel Tire","created_at":"2025-09-23T05:30:53-05:00","handle":"terreno-t10-hardpack-gravel-sport","updated_at":"2026-10-13T08:36:02-05:00","published_at":"2025-10-01T09:22:34-05:00","template_suffix":null,"published_scope":"global","tags":"Discounted products, EP70, Gravel, Gravel Sport, IPP40, Sitewide, Tires","variants":[{"id":50727886487840,"product_id":10058309239072,"title":"700x35c \/ Black","price":"54.99","sku":"11A01110","position":1,"compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopif